  "update_count": 59,
  "description_snippet": "The character U+0F8C (TIBETAN SIGN INVERTED MCHU CAN) when used in a domain name in Chrome looks just like a space.\r\n\r\nThis can be abused to spoof a legitimate domain followed by a chain of the character, e.g. \"accounts.google.com<U+0F8C x 52>.bntk.pl\".\r\n\r\nI have created a domain https://important-d"
